---
import SegmentedControl from '@tram/design-system/interactive/SegmentedControl.astro';
import CatalogMap from '@tram/design-system/patterns/CatalogMap.astro';
import type { MapPoint } from '@tram/design-system/patterns/catalog-map.ts';
import Heading from '@tram/design-system/primitives/Heading.astro';
import Stack from '@tram/design-system/primitives/Stack.astro';
import Text from '@tram/design-system/primitives/Text.astro';
import { type CatalogShoe, catalogId, catalogName, catalogPath } from '../content/shoe-catalog';

export interface Props {
  /** Every shoe of the catalogue: each map places those whose maker states its two measures. */
  shoes: readonly CatalogShoe[];
}

const { shoes } = Astro.props;
// A shoe is on a map when its maker states both of its measures: none is placed by a guess.
const placed = (measure: (shoe: CatalogShoe) => number | null): MapPoint[] =>
  shoes.flatMap((shoe) => {
    const y = measure(shoe);
    return shoe.weightG === null || y === null ? [] : [{ id: catalogId(shoe), x: shoe.weightG, y, kind: shoe.terrain, label: catalogName(shoe), href: catalogPath(shoe) }];
  });
const views = [
  { key: 'stack', choice: 'Pes i alçada', title: 'Pes i alçada al taló', y: 'Alçada al taló', points: placed((shoe) => shoe.stackHeelMm), which: 'el pes i l’alçada al taló' },
  { key: 'drop', choice: 'Pes i drop', title: 'Pes i drop', y: 'Drop', points: placed((shoe) => shoe.dropMm), which: 'el pes i el drop' },
];
---

<!--
  The map of the catalogue (CLAUDE.md 9.3): the shoes placed by weight and by height, and by weight and by
  drop, which many more makers state. Both maps are in the page; an island shows one at a time, and without
  it they follow one another. The filters of the catalogue hide points on them as they hide rows in the list.
-->
<div class="maps" data-catalog-maps>
  <Stack gap={5}>
    <div class="choice"><SegmentedControl name="mapa" legend="Què es posa al mapa" options={views.map((view) => ({ value: view.key, label: view.choice }))} value="stack" /></div>
    {
      views.map((view) => (
        <section data-map-view={view.key}>
          <Stack gap={3}>
            <Heading level={3} size="sm">{view.title}</Heading>
            <Text size="sm" tone="muted" measure>
              Models al mapa: <span data-map-count>{view.points.length}</span>. {`Només hi surten els que declaren ${view.which}, de ${shoes.length} que n’hi ha al catàleg.`}
            </Text>
            <CatalogMap
              points={view.points}
              x={{ label: 'Pes', unit: 'g' }}
              y={{ label: view.y, unit: 'mm' }}
              label={`${view.title} dels models del catàleg`}
              kinds={{ road: 'Asfalt', trail: 'Muntanya' }}
              headings={{ name: 'Model', kind: 'Terreny' }}
              data="Les dades del mapa, en una taula"
            />
          </Stack>
        </section>
      ))
    }
    <Text size="sm" tone="muted" measure>
      Cada punt porta a la fitxa del model. El pes és el de la talla que pesa cada marca, i cada marca mesura l'alçada a la seva manera: el mapa situa els models, no els compara al mil·límetre. Els que coincideixen en les dues xifres es dibuixen de costat.
    </Text>
  </Stack>
</div>

<style>
  /* Choosing a map takes the island. Without it there is nothing to choose: both maps are shown. */
  .maps:not([data-ready]) .choice {
    display: none;
  }
</style>
